      "type": "text",
      "x": 2436,
      "y": 1044,
      "width": 273,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "for discussion · where it runs: TBC\n① runs the ACE ingestion DAG\n② POST business date X ready → P1\n   then waits for DailyCaseRun\n③ file windows: WIN 16:00, buyers\n④ report extracts 01:30, reruns\n⑤ cutover loads, backfills, recon\nnever touches rwb_* schemas",
